# Pretty URLs for the static labs. Netlify already serves an existing file
# before applying redirects, so these only make the intent explicit and keep
# the bare "/spike-lab" (no trailing slash) working in links we hand out.
# They do not apply to the Vite dev server, which answers "/spike-lab/" with
# the SPA shell — in-app links therefore point at the file itself.
/spike-lab     /spike-lab/index.html   200
/spike-lab/    /spike-lab/index.html   200

# SPA fallback for every React route. Must stay last.
/*    /index.html   200
